Logical: LogEnImageSupportingInformationCz
Id: ImageSupportingInformationCz
Title: "A.3.1 - Supporting Information"
Description: """Supporting Information - Information and data communicated by the imaging methods department that has an impact on the execution of the order or the interpretation of the examination results"""

* insert SetFmmandStatusRule (2, trial-use)

*  biometricData 0..1 Base "A.3.1.1 - Bimetric Data" """If the required clinical data are available, it is mandatory."""
*  biometricData.weight 1..1 Base "A.3.1.1.1 - Weight" """Subject weight"""
*  biometricData.weight.valueQuantity 1..1 Quantity "A.3.1.1.1.1 - Weight value" """Data value including unit of measurement."""
*  biometricData.weight.code 1..1 CodeableConcept "A.3.1.1.1.2 - Weight code" """Observation code identifying the meaning of the weight data"""
*  biometricData.weight.dateTime  1..1 dateTime "A.3.1.1.1.3 - Weight date and time" """The date of weight discovery"""
*  biometricData.height 1..1 Base "A.3.1.1.2 - Height" """Subject height"""
*  biometricData.height.valueQuantity 1..1 Quantity "A.3.1.1.2.1 - Height value" """Data value including unit of measurement."""
*  biometricData.height.code 1..1 CodeableConcept "A.3.1.1.2.2 - Height code" """Observation code identifying the meaning of the height data"""
*  biometricData.height.dateTime  1..1 dateTime "A.3.1.1.2.3 - Height date and time" """The date of height discovery"""
*  otherRelevantClinicalInformation 0..1 Base "A.3.1.2 - Other relevant clinical information" """Other clinical information relevant to performing the order or interpreting the results. This includes diagnoses and conditions that are not the reason for the examination but may affect its performance or interpretation."""
*  otherRelevantClinicalInformation.code 0..* CodeableConcept "A.3.1.2.1 - Code of other information" """Diagnoses and other clinical information that may affect the course or result of the examination or its interpretation (e.g. heart failure, claustrophobia, renal failure)"""
*  otherRelevantClinicalInformation.text 0..1 string "A.3.1.2.2 - Text of other information" """Clinical information necessary for correct order execution or interpretation of results."""
*  medication 0..* Base "A.3.1.3 - Medication" """Medication block containing information about medication that has an impact on the course or result of the examination or its interpretation."""
*  medication.identifier 0..* Identifier "A.3.1.3.1 - Medication identifier" """Identifier of medication"""
*  medication.code 0..* CodeableConcept "A.3.1.3.2 - Medication code" """Code of medication"""
*  medication.dose 0..1 Quantity "A.3.1.3.3 - Dose" """Dose of medication (e.g. 500 mg)"""
*  implant 0..* Base "A.3.1.4 - Implant" """List of implants or devices that affect the course of the examination or its interpretation."""
*  implant.type 1..1 CodeableConcept "A.3.1.4.1 - Implant type" """Type of implant"""
*  implant.identifier 0..* Identifier "A.3.1.4.2 - Implant identifier" """Standardized identifier, e.g. UDI, according to EU Regulation 2017/745, ZP code according to the health insurance company catalog"""
*  implant.model 1..1 string "A.3.1.4.3 - Implant model" """Specifies a specific model"""
*  implant.bodyPart 0..* CodeableConcept "A.3.1.4.4 - Body part" """Body part where it is implanted"""
*  urgentInformation 0..1 Base "A.3.1.5 - Urgent information" """Urgent information block in the same structure as in other types of documents (discharge report, patient summary)"""
*  urgentInformation.allergyIntolerance 1..* Base "A.3.1.5.1 - Allergy intolerance" """Allergies and intolerances that may affect order fulfillment or interpretation of results"""
*  urgentInformation.allergyIntolerance.identifier 0..* Identifier "A.3.1.5.1.1 - Identifier of allergy intolerance" """Identifier of the allergy or intolerance record"""
*  urgentInformation.allergyIntolerance.clinicalStatus 0..1 CodeableConcept "A.3.1.5.1.2 - Clinical status of allergy intolerance" """Clinical status of the allergy or intolerance (active, inactive, resolved)"""
*  urgentInformation.allergyIntolerance.type 0..1 code "A.3.1.5.1.3 - Type of allergy intolerance" """Type of the reaction (allergy or intolerance)"""
*  urgentInformation.allergyIntolerance.category 0..* code "A.3.1.5.1.4 - Category of allergy intolerance" """Category of the substance causing the reaction (food, medication, environment, biologic)"""
*  urgentInformation.allergyIntolerance.code 1..1 CodeableConcept "A.3.1.5.1.5 - Code of allergy intolerance" """Code identifying the allergy or intolerance (substance or condition)"""
*  urgentInformation.allergyIntolerance.note 0..* string "A.3.1.5.1.6 - Note of allergy intolerance" """Additional note on the allergy or intolerance"""
*  urgentInformation.warnings 0..* string "A.3.1.5.2 - Warning" """Warnings and notices that may affect order fulfillment or interpretation of results"""
*  limitationOfPatientMobility 1..1 Base "A.3.1.6 - Limitation of patient mobility" """Describes the patient's mobility limitations"""
*  limitationOfPatientMobility.dateTime 1..1 dateTime "A.3.1.6.1 - Date and time of information" """Date of information discovery"""
*  limitationOfPatientMobility.code 1..1 CodeableConcept "A.3.1.6.2 - Code of information" """Observation code identifying the meaning of the observation (limitation of patient mobility)"""
*  limitationOfPatientMobility.value 0..1 CodeableConcept "A.3.1.6.3 - Value of information" """Coded value describing the patient's mobility limitation"""
*  otherInformation 0..* Base "A.3.1.7 - Other information" """Other formalized observation communicated to the implementing workplace"""
*  otherInformation.dateTime 1..1 dateTime "A.3.1.7.1 - Date and time of information" """Date of information discovery"""
*  otherInformation.code 1..1 CodeableConcept "A.3.1.7.2 - Code of information" """Observation code identifying the meaning of the observation (week of gestation, etc.)"""
*  otherInformation.value 0..1 Quantity "A.3.1.7.3 - Value of information" """Observation value including unit of measurement."""
